
# Build / deps (adjust to stack once code lands)
# Editors
# Env / secrets
# OS
*.local
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
bin/
build/
desktop.ini
dist/
node_modules/
obj/
# The plugins, which live under the server project. Anchored at that path rather than written
# loosely, because a rule that happens to match is a rule that stops matching: before this was
# moved, the models were excluded only by a `ggml-*.bin` glob and the engine binaries only by the
# `bin/` rule meant for .NET output. Both would have kept working here by luck, and the compiled
# library and the three config.json would not have — a `git add -A` would have put a 1.9 MB .pyd and
# the owner's settings into history.
src/Aurora.Server/plugins/*/config.json
src/Aurora.Server/plugins/*/bin/
src/Aurora.Server/plugins/*/models/

# Everything vendored except Aurora's own. The compiled library does not belong in history; the
# speech client is a copy of the voice plugin's speech.py, and a checkout without it is a Discord
# plugin that will not start. Written as vendor/* rather than vendor/ because git does not look
# inside a directory it has already excluded, so nothing below it could be let back in.
src/Aurora.Server/plugins/discord/vendor/*
!src/Aurora.Server/plugins/discord/vendor/__init__.py
!src/Aurora.Server/plugins/discord/vendor/aurora_voice/
src/Aurora.Server/plugins/discord/vendor/aurora_voice/__pycache__/

# Runtime state and operator secrets. The real deployment lives outside this tree
# (%LOCALAPPDATA%\Aurora on Windows, ~/.local/share/aurora elsewhere), so these are
# defensive: they keep a key or a database out of history if anyone ever points a
# data root at the checkout.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.anchor
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
aurora.passphrase.json
bearer.txt
*.token
secrets.json
sandbox/

# Third-party speech engines and voice models are downloaded, not authored here. Kept as a second
# net under any path, since the rules above only cover where the plugins live today.
*.onnx
*.onnx.json
ggml-*.bin
piper.exe
whisper-cli.exe

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
